              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 26:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati uho Abimeleki na Fikoli, ariyekala mkpwulu wa majeshi, aphiya kpwa Burahimu, achendamuamba, “Mlungu a phamwenga nawe kahi ya chila chitu uhendacho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi niapira kpwa Mlungu kukala kundanichenga, ama kuchenga anangu wala uvyazi wangu. Mimi vyokala muaminifu kpwako, apa kukala nawe undakala muaminifu kpwangu, na kpwa tsi ihi usagalayo dza mjeni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
